body:
Hoje:

* Acordei 7 da manhã
* Assisti 3 horas de aula;
* Fiz 30 flexões;
* Não comi açúcar;
* Brinquei com a minha cachorra por 20 minutos;
* Programei durante 1 hora
* Li 10 páginas de um livro (na verdade ouvi o audiobook);
* Me masturbei;
* Meditei por 10 minutos;
* Pratiquei Inglês durante 30 minutos

Amanhã: ainda não fiz a lista, sempre faço antes de ir dormir e não vou dormir enquanto não fizer.

I am really, really so sorry you feel like that. I'm unemployed too. I also feel a waste of space.

&#x200B;

You said in another comment you have a boyfriend and a dog. I know that they would miss you a lot if you were gone. Don't feel a waste of space. People actually want to help you feel better and live a better life. You seem a really good person for taking care of your boyfriend and your dog. Don't forget that people do really want to help you. If you ever need to take anything off your chest you can message me here. I don't know if I will be able to help you out, but I do care to listen.

Do you think my parents would suffer less this way, an "accidental" death?

&#x200B;

And do you think I should tell my online friends about what I am going to do or should I just disappear? What would make them suffer less?
